# Scenario: power-on sequence: reset releases after supply is good, the PLL locks, then the core is enabled.
timing "Power-on reset and enable sequence"
[Supply and clock]
CLK: pppppppppppp
VDD_OK: 001111111111
---
[Control]
RST_N: 000001111111
PLL_LOCK: 000000011111
EN: 000000000111
STATE: x=...=.=.=.. data: ["RESET", "CALIBRATE", "IDLE", "RUN"]
